{"summary":"床脚下土是取自床底下的泥土，性平无毒，外用可治疗犬咬伤，需用水调和后敷于伤口，并配合艾灸七壮。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《拾遗》）","translation":"出自《本草拾遗》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"犬咬，和水敷之，灸七壮（藏器）。","translation":"治疗狗咬伤，取适量床脚下土用水调和后敷在伤口上，再施以艾灸七壮。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E5%9C%9F%E9%83%A8#床腳下土","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:20.994Z"}